flowchart LR
    user([User]) --> lb
    subgraph cloud [Cloud region]
        lb[Load balancer]
        subgraph app [App tier]
            api1[API 1]
            api2[API 2]
        end
        subgraph data [Data tier]
            primary[(Primary)]
            replica[(Replica)]
        end
        lb --> api1 & api2
        api1 & api2 --> primary
        primary -.-> replica
    end
    primary --> backup[(Backup)]
